  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │ EnsoulSharp SDK:  265 .cs + 9 .json + 78 skin .cs + 37 MoreLinq    │
  │                  = 389 files total                                   │
  │                                                                      │
  │ NightSharp SDK:   58 .h + 9 .json = 67 files                       │
  │                  + 18 C++-only files (core/, plugins/, menu/)       │
  │                  = 85 files total                                    │
  │                                                                      │
  │ Port ratio:       130 EnsoulSharp files → 58 C++ .h files (gộp)    │
  │ Skipped:         ~135 C#-specific files (N/A)                       │
  │                                                                      │
  │ Feature Coverage: ~99%                                               │
  │ - ✅ 100%: 16/16 modules fully ported                               │
  │ - ⚡ Minor: Shops list (dùng IsShopOpen thay)                       │
  │ - ✅ Better: S26 items, Smart scoring, AutoLevel, RecallTracker,    │
  │              SummonerTracker, InputText, Samira/Mel W collision      │
  │                                                                      │
  │ Remaining: 8 in-game test items (9.1-9.8) — cần inject test        │
  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
